### Get All Products List
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### Validation Test (Empty Name - Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 100
}

### Validation Test (Negative Price - Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "price": -50
}
### Success Test (Valid Data - Should return 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Valid Product",
  "price": 250
}
